# Launching from a scenario: no test, just a world to explore.
# scenario.world.ts builds the world: a sensor, a light, and nightfall and
# daybreak every 30 ticks. scenario.env.json is the same world as env JSON.
# - F5 with this file open runs scenario.world.ts beside it. The "Debug IC10
#   Scenario" button on scenario.world.ts or scenario.env.json does the
#   same, as do the launch configurations "Debug the IC10 scenario ...".
# - It runs as fast as it can until you stop it, so set a breakpoint first:
#   on "add Nights Nights r3" with the condition r3 == 1, then Run Until
#   Event "daybreak", and watch Nights in Registers.
alias Sensor d0
alias Light d1
alias Nights r15
define Dark 273
loop:
yield
l r0 Sensor Temperature
slt r1 r0 Dark
l r2 Light On
s Light On r1
sgt r3 r1 r2 # it has just got dark
add Nights Nights r3
j loop
